{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:8e92d04e1d91e623","name":"Turret Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-8e92d04e1d91e623","title":"Turret Talent Tree","revision":19596,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:15:12Z","sha256":"7461a9db1bbc782b200ece22c8d7849d26281c045e2fae2af292ec491f3c01d4","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19596","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Turret%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-8e92d04e1d91e623","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can construct small, disposable, automated Turrets.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Blaster Turret I"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," you can create a Turret (Size Tiny, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"}," +4, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +4, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," 10, 10 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"}," 8) that can be mounted to any flat surface. The Turret fires as a standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Pistol","referenceId":"reference:38dcc06542ba096c"}," once per round, using your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"}," plus your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"}," bonus and dealing 3d6 points of Energy damage.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Turret fires at any target you designate (a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},", once per round on your turn), though you must remain adjacent to the Turret to control it. The Turret is expended at the end of the encounter.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Blaster Turret II"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Blaster Turret I"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Your Turret's capabilities increase in the following ways: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"}," +8, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +8, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," 12, 15 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"}," 10, and the Turret deals 3d8 points of Energy damage. The Turret can be directed by a remote control at a range of 12 squares.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Blaster Turret III"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Blaster Turret I"]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Blaster Turret II"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Your Turret gains the ability to fire twice per round, with a -5 penalty on each attack roll, and gains ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"}," 5.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Ion Turret"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Blaster Turret I"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can construct a Turret that is highly effective against ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},". The Turret deals ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ion"}," damage instead of normal damage.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Stun Turret"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Blaster Turret I"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can construct a nonlethal Turret. The Turret deals ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage instead of normal damage.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Turret Self-Destruct"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Blaster Turret I"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Your Turret self-destructs automatically when it reaches 0 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},". It explodes in a 2-Square radius, dealing its normal damage. If you are adjacent to the Turret, you can disable this feature as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
